WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.042 --> 00:00:04.170
Gabby and her fiancé embarked
on a cross-country trip

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.464
in Gabby's 2012 white Ford van.

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:11.720
It was like every parent's nightmare.
Just like, in a flash of a second.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.221
She's gone. She's missing.

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:15.557
Let's just take a minute,
step back and breathe.

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:18.852
The thoughts that were going
through my head were something,

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:21.062
something really bad
has happened to her.

00:00:21.896 --> 00:00:24.858
That time when we were
looking for Gabby was...

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:25.942
-Horrific.
-It's a blur.

00:00:25.942 --> 00:00:27.694
It's really like a...

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:28.486
It's horrific.

00:00:29.524 --> 00:00:32.438
The media and the
internet just went crazy.

00:00:32.438 --> 00:00:35.650
I think the hashtag #FINDGABBY
hit like over a billion people.

00:00:35.651 --> 00:00:40.112
Her bright, beautiful light
touched a lot of people.

00:00:40.112 --> 00:00:43.309
I am gonna walk down here a
little bit because I see something.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:44.561
Right here...

00:00:45.626 --> 00:00:48.253
okay, is where they think that
it's a shadow of someone digging.

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:51.317
There was definitely
more to this relationship

00:00:51.317 --> 00:00:54.028
than was being
shown on social media.

00:00:54.468 --> 00:00:56.929
So, a body has been found

00:00:56.929 --> 00:00:59.765
in the area that they were
searching for Gabby Petito.

00:01:00.144 --> 00:01:02.809
It's still unbelievable.
I don't understand it.

00:01:02.809 --> 00:01:04.394
These are all I have left now.

00:01:05.384 --> 00:01:08.168
I really don't know what justice
for Gabby looks like at this point.

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:10.837
Everybody deserves
to feel safe at home.

00:01:12.739 --> 00:01:14.574
Everybody deserves to
be found that is missing.

00:01:15.614 --> 00:01:16.448
Everyone.

